{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteenの投票終了まで残りわずかとなりました...(＞＜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"既にたくさんの方が\nPopteen買って投票したよ～と\n言ってくださっていて\n本当に本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくださって\nありがとうございます(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの応援で、\nもっともっと気持ちが強くなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteenの専属モデルになりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで諦めたくない！可能性をもって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーデバトルで\nたくさんコーディネート披露してるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと私をみてほしい！ってのと\n誌面でもっとひなをみたいって\n思ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服ファッションショー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7849462/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服ファッションショー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7849462/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops:Crayme,\nレースアップが可愛いくってお気に入り。\nなにかとレースアップに惹かれる～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7849462/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドット柄のロンパース。\n肩がフリルになってるのがお気に入り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7849462/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops:dazzlin\nこのトップスは、\n後ろにリボンついてるから\n後ろ姿もかわいいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7849462/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョーカーを\n二重にしてブレスレットに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/24/7849462/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手首に、レースのヘアタイと\nパステルビーズのブレスレット♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の記事に続く、、"}],"source":"archive"}